Cozy, bright and functional 2 bedroom flat, ideal for own housing or investment, located in a quiet area with excellent access.

The property stands out for its excellent sun exposure, providing plenty of natural light throughout the day, and also offers the possibility of enjoying a magnificent sunset, making the moments spent on the balcony or terrace even more special.

It has a balcony, terrace and garage, providing comfort, outdoor space and convenience. It is equipped with electric shutters and central heating, ensuring greater comfort.

Inserted in a building of only two floors, providing a quiet and more reserved environment.

The location is also one of its strengths, being close to the Covões Hospital, schools, shops, services and other amenities, allowing you to enjoy everything you need on a daily basis.

An excellent opportunity for those looking for a bright, comfortable, well-equipped flat with outdoor spaces where you can enjoy a privileged view and magnificent sunsets.

Come and see it!

